# Riot Games API key.
#
# Grab one at https://developer.riotgames.com (sign in with your Riot account —
# the development key is on the dashboard).
#
# Development keys expire every 24 hours. If summoner lookups suddenly start
# returning 403, regenerate the key and restart the dev server.
#
# Champion browsing does not need this — it runs off Data Dragon, Riot's
# public CDN. Only summoner/mastery/match features require a key.
RIOT_API_KEY=RGAPI-xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx
